    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Biiknooda fuga ghayi siipaleak",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA gayghabwayda fuga Yakobo, ak gayghwaloat gicha Israeli, ak gayghoadealda jeeda ng'eanyiida nyaawa nea gabwageat ak gayghapka rabasta ak gwandeayi sea fuga gheeh Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga eemoojiga gayghaweat fuga Israeli gabiikta ng'eanyiida ghayi adaw NG'UTAMIIDA. Ak aba hoowa gaygagadiiyeesa fuga Israeli gawuurji soomjooga gadeemga ea headiga. Ak fuga ghayi abaleak gayghoah fuga ng'uta aba heeda fuga ang'waay ak gaygoombal fuga ghayi ghabwas.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sugoocheanda Babeli gwanda jeeda ng'eanyiida fuga nimeewa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eaweedida NG'UTAMIIDA gaygagoonyi miyeenooda iing'ata gurmeahiidaang'u, ea iing'ata sawanadeadaang'u, ea iing'ata gadiyeeda ghayi hang'waay sinung' sinean, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaysarmana ak gishadayi sugoocheanda Babeli nea giyeeni:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ASEETA gayghwalas uhuuda Babeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gaydang'eat dang'uchi saawa,” gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA lugweega, “ak gaydeaheeli sea Babeli ak ghaalaschi uhuuda haleanjeeda sean eara boosteanga, mayghoabit diibiga ea gea duu eeji, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ng'eanyiini gayghoah heechea goobiita usibicheanda, ea dabaschoojiga beega, ak gaydeabuus deasheagiit aba gheabuuscheanda jea dalas uhuuda, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ASEETA gayghwalas uhuuda Ashuru",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ASEETA gayghwalas uhuuda fuga Filisti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
